@@ -0,0 +1,56 @@
+'use strict'
+
+// Regression test for CVE-2025-71329 (CWE-835: infinite loop).
+//
+// Crafted ISOBMFF/HEIF-, ICNS- and JXL-style containers with zero-size /
+// under-sized box or entry headers used to make image-size's box/entry
+// scanners loop forever, because the read offset never advanced. The fix
+// forces every scanner to always make progress and to reject the malformed
+// input with a `TypeError('Invalid <format>')` instead of hanging.
+//
+// These fixtures are the exact upstream regression inputs added in fix commit
+// e6e83a5578961de81f6d5834d90fb7430d8f29a5. We exercise the built package
+// entry (../dist/index.cjs) — the published npm artifact ships compiled output
